    "text": "Strong acid + Strong base mixture <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>]</mo></math> So <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> will be more <br/><math><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>800</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>0.05</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1.3</mn></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/>(b) The ionic product of water is temperature dependent <br/>(c) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>⇌</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></m